<h5>Posts</h5>
<p>Write blog posts with excerpt, category, featured image, optional <strong>visual layout builder</strong> (frontend editor) and optional <strong>block builder</strong>, tags (comma-separated), publish date, and optional <strong>content width</strong> override for the public post layout. Visual layout takes precedence over blocks and body when saved. In the frontend editor: choose column layouts per row, add modules from the side panel, and reorder with ↑ ↓. Published posts appear on <code>/blog</code> (blog listing width is set under System → General → Public site theme).</p>
<p><strong>Create everything on the form:</strong> Upload featured or block images here; click tag chips or type new tag names (auto-created); add a new category without leaving the editor.</p>
<p><strong>SEO &amp; social:</strong> SEO title, meta description (150–160 chars), featured share image (1200×630 recommended), optional <code>noindex</code>, and <strong>content width</strong> override (narrow / normal / wide) for the public post layout.</p>
<p><strong>LLM / AI:</strong> Plain-language summary for assistants; JSON at <code>/blog/{slug}.json</code>; Schema.org <code>BlogPosting</code> on the public HTML. Listed in <code>/llms.txt</code> when published and not noindex.</p>
<p><strong>Comments:</strong> Visitors can leave comments when enabled under General → Discussion. Moderate under <code>/admin/comments</code>.</p>
<p><strong>Featured image:</strong> Upload or pick on the post form. Used on the blog listing and as Open Graph / Twitter Card image. Recommended size: <strong>1200×630 px</strong>. Public URL: <code>/share/media/{id}</code>.</p>
<p>Admin: <code>/admin/posts</code></p>
